# Report digest updater

`Main` is intended to be invoked by a folder-watcher integration with the changed report's relative path as `changed_report_path`. It requests explicit approval before processing report and digest contents with the configured external model. It asks again before attempting a digest update, and the `DigestFiles` tool also requires approval.

## File setup

The `ReportFiles` tool is read-only and confined to `reports/`. The `DigestFiles` tool is confined to `digest/` and reads or updates `digest.txt` there. Keep the digest and reports in those configured roots. The workflow does not create directories or accept arbitrary absolute paths.

## Failure handling

An unclear or denied approval, missing report, failed model or failed file operation halts the run without proceeding to the digest update. Retries are disabled; retry work by starting a new workflow invocation.

## Tests

Run `weave test main.loom` to exercise the approval and failure routes using scripted models. Scripted agents do not execute tool calls, so these tests verify workflow routing rather than actual filesystem effects.
=== end
